1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,640
That little spoon rigged up we got on these rocks and see if we can't catch a bullet.
我们在这些岩石边用那个小匙形钓具试试，看看能不能钓到鱼。

2
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:23,990
Look at that beautiful little fish look at that that's such a pretty fish.
看这条漂亮的小鱼，看，多漂亮的一条鱼。

3
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:43,350
I've already gotten like six or seven strikes in ten casts there's tons of them in here.
我抛十次已经有大概六七次鱼咬钩了，这里鱼特别多。

4
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:56,070
There we go beautiful you got it lift up your tip lift you up to your tip.
好了，漂亮，钓到了。把竿尖抬起来，抬起来。

5
00:00:56,080 --> 00:01:05,440
Oh wow look at that that's a nice little pull look can this be mine would you rather eat that or hot dogs.
噢，看看，真不错。看，这能归我吗？你更想吃这个还是热狗？

6
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:14,880
Oh I would rather eat this well let you eat this pollock that's a nice one oh here we go yeah I'll take you okay.
我更想吃这个。那就让你吃这条鳕鱼，真不错。噢，又来了，好，我来，好的。

7
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:25,040
Oh jake oh did you play in the tide pool and you got all wet oh okay well we better go get you warmed up.
噢，Jake，你是不是在潮池里玩，弄得全湿了？好吧，我们得去让你暖和起来。

8
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:30,560
Well jake's wet and tom's hungry I think it's time to go take our fish and go make some dinner.
Jake 湿透了，Tom 也饿了。我想该带着鱼去做晚饭了。

9
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:51,110
Well let's get a fire going okay there you go jake are you warmer.
好了，我们把火生起来。好了，Jake，你暖和些了吗？

10
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:55,040
Well in addition to that little fish we caught we have some interesting food to eat tonight.
除了刚钓到的那条小鱼，今晚还有一些有意思的食物。

11
00:01:55,040 --> 00:02:00,709
I figured we would have some classic hot dogs so I've got hot dogs in a can.
我想我们可以吃些经典的热狗，所以带了罐装热狗。

12
00:02:00,719 --> 00:02:04,080
Yeah that's right they sell hot dogs in jars and cans out here.
没错，这里卖装在玻璃罐和铁罐里的热狗。

13
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:27,559
I also brought along this disposable barbecue they have these all over the place here in the uk so I figured I'd give one a go yes.
我还带了这个一次性烧烤炉，在英国这里到处都有，所以我想试试。对。

14
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:41,430
Now unfortunately I don't have a lot of ketchup is that okay.
不过可惜我番茄酱不多，可以吗？

15
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:54,550
You got this little canned spaghetti noodles like this raw yeah well here it's a spaghetti dog you guys like your hot dogs.
还有这点罐装意面。像这样？生的？对。给，这就是意面热狗。你们喜欢热狗吗？

16
00:02:54,560 --> 00:03:04,149
Got some welsh cakes here top welsh butter on a welsh cake there you go.
这里有一些威尔士小圆饼，上面抹威尔士黄油。给你。

17
00:03:04,159 --> 00:03:25,770
Oh look at that some fresh pollock can I get much fresher than that hey do you want some of this.
噢，看，新鲜的鱼，还能比这更新鲜吗？嘿，你要尝一点吗？

18
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:37,839
I swear it looks like someone's been here with a lawn mower this sheep just trimmed the grass so perfectly.
我发誓，这里看起来像有人用割草机修过。羊把草啃得这么整齐。

19
00:03:37,839 --> 00:03:45,670
You know I'm not surprised golf was invented in scotland the whole land looks like a golf green.
难怪高尔夫是在苏格兰发明的，整个地方看起来就像高尔夫果岭。

20
00:03:45,680 --> 00:04:01,190
Well it was a bit of a hike it's where we had our campfire right down there whoo would I ever bring.
走上来还是有点累。我们刚才生火的地方就在下面。呼，后面的字幕不太清楚。

21
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:30,640
Head upstairs I'll bring up the stuff here tom here hey guys you can take a seat on the sheep tonight would you like some dessert.
上楼去，我把东西拿上来。Tom，给你。孩子们，今晚可以坐在字幕所说的 sheep 上，要吃甜点吗？

22
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:37,759
Mini battenburg cakes I love these battenberg cakes it's like cake jam and almond flavored fondant around it.
迷你 Battenburg 蛋糕。我很喜欢这种蛋糕，里面是蛋糕和果酱，外面裹着杏仁味糖皮。

23
00:04:37,759 --> 00:04:44,080
They are amazing you know the historic sites are nice but it's things like this that keep me coming back to the uk.
它们太好吃了。历史景点是不错，但让我不断回英国来的，还是这种东西。

24
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:52,080
Oh thank you oh yeah are you guys full do you want to eat another cake yes.
噢，谢谢。你们吃饱了吗？还想再吃一块蛋糕吗？想。

25
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:58,560
It's getting late listen do you guys want to sleep here tonight or do you want to sleep outside the castle outside.
时间不早了。听着，你们今晚想睡在这里，还是睡在城堡外面？外面。
